00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.000
Help yourself.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.000
Eve?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.000
Ed?

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.000
Prescription on this bottle is dated the first of the week.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.000
Chronic gastritis.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Fresh fruit would tie him in knots.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.000
Maybe his friends like it.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Ed.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.000
Two-day-old paper, oblong space in the center of it.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.000
Margin splattered with dried fruit.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.000
And water spots.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.000
Carney had a bird in here.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.000
